{
  "key_path": "TypesAndPrivileges",
  "content": "<1>Admin account types and their privileges</1> <br> <br> <2>Full admin</2> <br> Workspace configuration, room creation and administration, ability to invite and manage users in the workspace and in virtual rooms, ability to manage access rights. <br> <br> <3>Room admin</3> <br> Room administration and archiving, user invitation and management. Several admins can be assigned to a room. <br> <br> <4>User</4> <br> Users can create and edit files in the room, but can't create rooms, manage users, or access settings.",
